-9. Mr. Whitlock \"doesn't do paperwork.\"\n   Told Rafael to get it or we back-up withhold going forward. Whitlock cell per Rafael: (843) 555-0190.\n3. Mei-Ling qualifies as a real estate professional? She says 900+ hrs but also works 30 hrs/wk\n   as a dental hygienist. Not on these facts. Passive loss limits apply (Form 8582).\n4. Refund direct deposit: Lowcountry Federal checking, routing 053255064, account 20 4471 08836.\n5. Our fee ($1,650) to the card on file: Mastercard 5577-4144-8335-0067, exp. 04/27, code 339.\n   (Moved to the vault 2/3; shred this line.)\n6. Estimated payments made: 4/15 $3,000; 6/16 $3,000; 9/15 $3,000; 1/15/26 $4,500.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "359 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["B. Kowalczyk", "Rafael Santos", "Mei-Ling Santos", "Darnell Whitlock", "Rafael", "Ignatius", "Mei-Ling"], "companies": ["Kowalczyk & Farrow CPAs, LLC", "Palmetto Coastal Property Management", "Lowcountry Federal Savings Bank", "Santos Family Rentals LLC", "Zelle", "Santos Rentals", "example", "Sea Island Roofing & Sheet Metal", "Whitlock", "Lowcountry Federal", "Mastercard"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Charleston", "SC", "Folly Beach", "Sea Island", "Lowcountry Federal"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["SSN", "DOB", "disregarded", "W-9"], "names": ["Rafael", "Mei-Ling", "Ignatius"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.09999999403953552, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 28, "text": "Kowalczyk & Farrow CPAs, LLC", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Kowalczyk & Farrow CPAs, LLC"